OL,3,ANanotyrannus skeleton auctioned for
OL,4,A$47.3m in New York
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mounted skeleton of a
OL,7,Fnewly-identified dinosaur once mistaken
OL,8,Ffor a young Tyrannosaurus rex has just
OL,9,Fbeen sold at auction for a colossal
OL,10,F$47.3m (#35.5m).
OL,12,FNicknamed "Jodi", the roughly
OL,13,F10-foot-tall (3m) skeleton was
OL,14,Fauctioned by Sotheby's in New York. The
OL,15,Fsale comes a year after researchers
OL,16,Fconfirmed that the skeleton belongs to
OL,17,Fa distinct genus.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
