OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANanotyrannus skeleton auctioned for
OL,4,A$47.3m in New York
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Late Cretaceous carnivore was
OL,7,Fexpected to fetch at least $9m when it
OL,8,Fwent under the hammer on Tuesday. The
OL,9,Fauction comes after Sotheby's sold a
OL,10,FTyrannosaurus rex, dubbed "Gus", for a
OL,11,Frecord $50.1m in July.
OL,13,FThe sale comes amid debate in the
OL,14,Fscientific community over whether
OL,15,Fdinosaur remains should be sold
OL,16,Fprivately or displayed publicly.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
